[3.884182, "o", "        # Public FDA Label Data\r\n\r\n        This directory contains only public task inputs for `fda-hard-numeric-dosage`.\r\n\r\n        - `labels.jsonl` has full FDA label rows with `label_raw` and `chunks`.\r\n        - `questions.jsonl` has 8 public questions.\r\n        - Gold answers, references, citations, and curated context are not included here.\r\n\r\n        Labels included:\r\n        - Lopinavir-Ritonavir (`4b1caefa-e6a2-42f3-9194-6dc1dd9e6d85`)\r\n- Emtricitabine, Rilpivirine, Tenofovir Disoproxil Fumarate (`d9a4185e-43fa-4aeb-9b0f-8db01b166038`)\r\n- CELECOXIB (`27f17ae7-939b-402e-9498-3b6611104089`)\r\n- Lenalidomide (`ed7a3099-ce31-4865-b212-358d9ff6261b`)\r\n"]
