[171.455473, "o", "Chunk 132 (PASSAGE_0132): 'Endoscopic Studies\\nThe correlation between findings of short-term endoscopic studies with celecoxib capsules and the relative incidence of clinically '\r\nChunk 136 (PASSAGE_0136): 'Gastrointestinal Bleeding, Ulceration, and Perforation\\nAdvise patients to report symptoms of ulcerations and bleeding, including epigastric pain, dysp'\r\nChunk 144 (PASSAGE_0144): 'Use of NSAIDS and Low-Dose Aspirin\\nInform patients not to use low-dose aspirin concomitantly with celecoxib capsules until they talk to their healthca'\r\nChunk 145 (PASSAGE_0145): 'Medication Guide for Nonsteroidal Anti-inflammatory Drugs (NSAIDs)\\nWhat is the most important information I should know about medicines called Non-Ste'\r\n"]
